     A          R PH001                     TEXT('EDI Transmission Data')
     A            H0CO#     R               REFFLD(CO#)
     A            H0FND     R               REFFLD(FND)
     A            H0FYR     R               REFFLD(FYR)
     A            H0CASE    R               REFFLD(CASE)
     A            H0TSET    R               REFFLD(DS3)
     A                                      TEXT('Transaction set ID')
